# This folder contains original image versus segmentation comparisons in order to visually assess segmentation quality and pipeline workflow. Below are listed the respective files illustrative function:

# preprocessing: - images from left to right illustrate the segmentation workflow
#overlay: - direct comparison of segmentation and original microscopy image (grayscale)
#crowded_nuclei: - exhibits a example image of dense nuclei clustering in the original image, and the performace of the pipeline 
#Segmentation_pipeline_Flowchart : - flowchart of segmentation workflow for illustrative understanding 
